From f84213e6c3d2cd0e40b34656e3d3143f06d13210 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
by: triplecN
Subject: [PATCH 01/20] LWMA difficulty, RandomX verification
 cost, emission, data directory

LWMA-1 per-block retargeting (N=60, T=60 s), the RandomX proof-of-work check
outside cs_main with a per-block-hash cache, the 5-then-10 CCCN emission
schedule, and the CacheCoin data directory and pid file names.
